:: Character Sheet

# Character Sheet

''Name:'' $player_name
''Class:'' $player_class
''Level:'' $level
''XP:'' $xp

### Attributes
- ''Strength:'' $strength
- ''Agility:'' $agility
- ''Intelligence:'' $intelligence
- ''Vitality:'' $vitality

### Health
- ''HP:'' $hp / $max_hp

### Wealth
- ''Gold:'' $gold

### Equipment
- Inventory: <<print $inventory.join(", ")>>
- Key Items:
  - Iron Sword: <<if $has_iron_sword>>Yes<<else>>No<</if>>
  - Lantern: <<if $has_lantern>>Yes<<else>>No<</if>>
  - Healing Potion: <<if $has_healing_potion>>Yes<<else>>No<</if>>
  - Amulet of Thornwood: <<if $has_amulet>>Yes<<else>>No<</if>>
  - Map: <<if $has_map>>Yes<<else>>No<</if>>

### Exploration
- Locations Visited: <<print $visited_locations.join(", ")>>
- Forest Cleared: <<if $forest_cleared>>Yes<<else>>No<</if>>
- Castle Explored: <<if $castle_explored>>Yes<<else>>No<</if>>
- Amulet Recovered: <<if $amulet_recovered>>Yes<<else>>No<</if>>

### Relationships
- Mara Trust: $mara_trust
- Garrett Trust: $garrett_trust
- Elara Trust: $elara_trust
- Mara's Secret Known: <<if $maras_secret_known>>Yes<<else>>No<</if>>
- Garrett's Suspicion: <<if $garrett_betrayed>>Yes<<else>>No<</if>>

